(7738513, 1275959, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perfect control of depth of field, the full front of the spoonbill, and the perch.  Absolutely lovely bokeh.  The bird''s smack center position works well, buoyed by the sides'' softness and measured interest.  So, a daring composition.  Pretty and cheery.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect control of depth of field, the full front of the spoonbill, and the perch.  Absolutely lovely bokeh.  The bird''s smack center position works well, buoyed by the sides'' softness and measured interest.  So, a daring composition.  Pretty and cheery.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-02-14 22:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7738514, 1275843, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice study of pollen on anthers.  They kind of levitate above stamens and petals. (As per google research.)  They look like shoes, dancing as seen from below in a mirror world.  Wild.</td>', 'Nice study of pollen on anthers.  They kind of levitate above stamens and petals. (As per google research.)  They look like shoes, dancing as seen from below in a mirror world.  Wild.', '2023-02-14 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7738515, 1275978, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lovely view of the world, peaceful and insubstantial.  The orange flower spray is like a bell summoning sleepy nature to arise.  I like how the vegetation fades to abstraction.  Ineffably beautiful.</td>', 'A lovely view of the world, peaceful and insubstantial.  The orange flower spray is like a bell summoning sleepy nature to arise.  I like how the vegetation fades to abstraction.  Ineffably beautiful.', '2023-02-14 22:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
