(7738523, 1275931, 173844, '<td valign="top">Saw this person, or one of his or her ilk, recently.  I enjoy this image more, as it''s a study and the person comes through.  Compelling.</td>', 'Saw this person, or one of his or her ilk, recently.  I enjoy this image more, as it''s a study and the person comes through.  Compelling.', '2023-02-14 22:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7738524, 1275881, 173844, '<td valign="top">Tender and fragile scene, almost imploring, as the branch reaches out in support of the leaves, as if offering us a peek of the workings of the world.  The leaves'' colors are entrancing. The swirling gray background nicely sets them off.  Good eye.</td>', 'Tender and fragile scene, almost imploring, as the branch reaches out in support of the leaves, as if offering us a peek of the workings of the world.  The leaves'' colors are entrancing. The swirling gray background nicely sets them off.  Good eye.', '2023-02-14 22:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7738525, 1275793, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is busy, yet charming and fanciful.  The streams of water are a flurry of diagonals, sparkling and dynamic, teasing the rectilinear background.  Has an off-hand feel that disencumbers it from stultifying expectations.  Very nice.</td>', 'This is busy, yet charming and fanciful.  The streams of water are a flurry of diagonals, sparkling and dynamic, teasing the rectilinear background.  Has an off-hand feel that disencumbers it from stultifying expectations.  Very nice.', '2023-02-14 22:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7738526, 1275750, 173844, '<td valign="top">This chomping insect is yet another wonder that surpasses the realm of human imagination.  Spot on depth of field on the head and stalk of grass.  What I really enjoy is the very thickness of the grass.  This is a perspective that allows one access to the insect''s world, admits one to transformation.  Thank you for it.</td>', 'This chomping insect is yet another wonder that surpasses the realm of human imagination.  Spot on depth of field on the head and stalk of grass.  What I really enjoy is the very thickness of the grass.  This is a perspective that allows one access to the insect''s world, admits one to transformation.  Thank you for it.', '2023-02-14 23:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
